{"id":"bb22eb42bae0cef9","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-weak-g-system.md","title":"Omega-Rule Extension of G","display":"df-weak-g-system — Omega-Rule Extension of G","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-weak-g-system","aliases":["92-df-weak-g-system"],"display":"df-weak-g-system — Omega-Rule Extension of G","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-omega-rule]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-theory-closure]]"],"source":"第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）","source_status":"原书 P.A.+ 的本地闭包重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-weak-g-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-weak-g-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-g-system — Omega-Rule Extension of G"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"166aa997e9977c14\" href=\"?note=166aa997e9977c14\" title=\"92-df-omega-rule\">92-df-omega-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 P.A.+ 的本地闭包重构"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-weak-g-system-—-Omega-Rule-Extension-$G^\\omega$\">df-weak-g-system — Omega-Rule Extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^\\omega\">\\(G^\\omega\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\">\\(\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\)</span> (omega-rule relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"166aa997e9977c14\" href=\"?note=166aa997e9977c14\" title=\"92-df-omega-rule\">92-df-omega-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (theory of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> (finitary first-order consequence closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\\)</span> (definition-target omega-rule closure)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}g\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T)=T\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\Gamma,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\;\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq T\\Longrightarrow\\psi\\in T)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}g\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T)=T\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\Gamma,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G\\;\n(\\Gamma\\subseteq T\\Longrightarrow\\psi\\in T)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^\\omega\">\\(G^\\omega\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>在普通有限一阶后承与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>规则下共同闭合所得的理论扩张；只闭合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>规则会漏掉以新结论为前提的有限推导</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-rule允许从所有实例的可证性推出全称量化</li>\n<li>是否一致或完备需要额外假设与定理，不能由定义直接推出</li>\n<li>这里直接定义的是理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)\\)</span>；它未自动给出符合<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>之有限规则格式的形式系统三元组</li>\n<li>用于对比系统G的不完全性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里取完整 ω 规则与有限后承的最小共同闭包，对应原书 P.A.+，不是原书随后提到的较弱可公理化规则。所有真句完备的结论仍要给外部证明，不能从最小闭包定义的名字推出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 X 章 p. 113（PDF 130）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-weak-g-system-—-Omega-Rule-Extension-$G^\\omega$","text":"df-weak-g-system — Omega-Rule Extension $G^\\omega$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"166aa997e9977c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"166aa997e9977c14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}_G$ (omega-rule relation, see [[92-df-omega-rule]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ (theory of $G$, see [[92-df-theory-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-clo